---
description: Faroese full name for a woman: one given name and one second name (Marjun Joensen, Eivør Hansdóttir). It draws from person/female/lastName, which carries the family names unchanged - a Faroese family name does not inflect for sex - and the patronymics in their -dóttir form. So a woman drawn from the head of the list shares her name with her brother, and one drawn from the tail does not: Hansson and Hansdóttir are the same father.
generator: tdc
locale: fo
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="fo.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="fo.person.female.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
